<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The one activity this library adds, merged into the player's manifest.

  There is no `package` attribute, which AGP 8 forbids outright, so `android:name`
  is written out in full rather than as the usual leading dot. The namespace the
  package would have supplied is in build.gradle instead.

  Translucent and not `Theme.NoDisplay`. NoDisplay is the theme that looks right for
  an activity with nothing to draw, and it throws: an activity wearing it has to be
  finished before its first `onResume` returns, and this one has to outlive the
  picker it launches. Translucent is the theme that lets it be invisible for as long
  as it needs to be — which is why there is no flash of a blank screen on the way to
  the picker.

  The configuration changes are the list Unity's own activity declares, taken whole
  rather than pruned to the ones a screen with nothing on it could care about. What is
  wanted is not to survive a rotation looking right — there is nothing to look at — it
  is not to be destroyed and recreated at all while the picker is up, and any change on
  that list would do it.

  Four things are deliberately absent, and all four look right, so each is worth a
  line: `launchMode` — anything but the default risks the result being delivered to a
  different instance than the one that asked; `taskAffinity` — a task of its own would
  put a second card in Recents and take the picker out of the player's task with it;
  `excludeFromRecents` and `noHistory` — the second of those finishes the activity the
  moment it stops, which is exactly what launching a picker does, so the result would
  arrive at nothing.

  No permissions. A document the user picked comes back as a per-URI grant, which is
  the whole reason this road exists where the storage permissions no longer lead
  anywhere.
-->
<manifest xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android">
    <application>
        <activity
            android:name="jp.radiumsoftware.jacquard.scoretransfer.ScoreTransferActivity"
            android:exported="false"
            android:theme="@android:style/Theme.Translucent.NoTitleBar"
            android:configChanges="mcc|mnc|locale|touchscreen|keyboard|keyboardHidden|navigation|orientation|screenLayout|uiMode|screenSize|smallestScreenSize|fontScale|layoutDirection|density" />
    </application>
</manifest>
